laces extérieures visiteurs, permettant de préserver des espaces paysagers agréables et une atmosphère résidentielle harmonieuse. Une adresse privilégiée entre lac et montagne pour habiter ou investir aux portes de Genève.","addr":"Impasse des Jardins","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182OWFlODBkNjk0MTFlNy42OTUxMTI5NyIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6OTAwLCJoZWlnaHQiOjkwMCwiZml0IjoiaW5zaWRlIn19LCJmaWxlSGFzaCI6Ijc4NGFkMzM0ZTU5Njg2Y2EyYTk3MTE3NmUyMzFjODczYTlmYjExYmJlM2QyMzVhNjg0NmNiNjA3OWM1OGFhMDgifQ==?signature=d8fa82bf286f9f8cd33dc766ad05dd444bc70e5555400599b3e4b5f50d59f829","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182OWFlODBkODQ2Njk1NS45NDE5NDQxMiIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6OTAwLCJoZWlnaHQiOjkwMCwiZml0IjoiaW5zaWRlIn19LCJmaWxlSGFzaCI6ImFmZGNkNGQwMjA3NGZjNGIyMjQyMGRlOGI4N2E3NWFiZTRiYjhlNTZmMGIyMTk5MThlZmUwZTJmNjE0NGQ4MDQifQ==?signature=9fe3b54d2f305086397efb8db145942c4ea8b849e4ca96e9db381e445faaf43a","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182OWFlODBkODZmMDc1MS43NTE3ODg1NSIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6OTAwLCJoZWlnaHQiOjkwMCwiZml0IjoiaW5zaWRlIn19LCJmaWxlSGFzaCI6IjdlMGY2NmM4NWI1ZmNhMzY5ZGZhZWYzYzc0ZTJiOTA5NzA5NDMwNTY0NzZmMDY1NTA3ODY5ZTQwMTYyNWJiNDIifQ==?signature=b06436ebbeda8cd80c5b0a58a16a8efa46efff48137d396bd9153142e9629606","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182OWFlODBkODgxMDQwMi40OTg4OTYxOCIsImVkaXRzIjp7InJlc2l6ZSI6eyJ3aWR0aCI6OTAwLCJoZWlnaHQiOjkwMCwiZml0IjoiaW5zaWRlIn19LCJmaWxlSGFzaCI6ImUxMGFiY2VkMWE5NjFlNDllMDY5OTJjZTE1MTExNjAzYTBlZmI0NjgxZDg2MWMyYTQxN2MwYTk3ZjNjYzk3NTkifQ==?signature=06005420a7953efe5b57c92fd802543adc82d0ca2cfe0cdb347c71cc6cc1a567","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6InVwbG9hZGluZ182OW